{
  "schema": "zeno-fcis/spec-parser-profile/1",
  "scope": [
    "Exact source-byte lexical stepping and complete validation of the actual borrowed Token stream, including numeric payloads, exact start/end bytes, one-based line/byte-column coordinates, identifier/hex spelling, inert empty spelling and the token budget.",
    "Complete postorder ordered-grammar derivation and indexed terminal frontier. Both core and extended generated grammars are checked for reproducible generation.",
    "Exact signed-magnitude conversion iff representable, and complete projection-tail conversion iff valid with every payload in order and no omitted suffix.",
    "Exact six-way lexical mapping to the actual CompareOp enum, with full-width ordered i128/u128 comparison semantics.",
    "Actual nongeneric ValueExpr arithmetic and division constructors preserve operator, policy and ordered operands; exact division-name mapping; bounded binary-height transfer.",
    "The actual lexer finalization body preserves its entire candidate token vector, appends exactly one supplied-span EOF, and on success binds the preceding tokens to the complete source with no internal EOF; an earlier failed scan cannot be admitted.",
    "The actual surface_lexer::lex body has an unconditional diagnostic-free-success contract: its output prefix independently validates against the entire original source, remains within the token budget, contains no internal EOF, and ends with exactly one empty-spelling EOF with the span supplied by the scan. Actual SourceLimits and Diagnostic representations are shared with the harness."
  ],
  "unproved": [
    "Grammar JSON to generated-table equivalence is reproducibility-checked, not formally proved.",
    "Parser-producer completeness and useful resource-envelope completeness.",
    "The entire typed AST fold, declaration lowering, and elaboration/evaluator composition.",
    "Rust compiler, Verus/SMT toolchain, allocation failures, and human intent.",
    "Real compiled Identifier, ProjectionPath and RelExpr operands are opaque external types with no assumed operations or semantic properties. Native Clone/Debug/Eq derives and the caller-to-certified-child mapping are outside the constructor proof.",
    "Scalar-height lemmas parameterize relational height; the complete source-to-AST height correspondence remains separate.",
    "The complete runtime syntax-resource preflight, its mapping from certified source children, and strict diagnostic collection are source-reviewed/tested rather than proved as a whole.",
    "The actual borrowed-token validator proves successful-check soundness. Acceptance completeness and native Token derive operations remain outside that theorem; the actual diagnostic-free lexer success implication is now separately proved.",
    "The lexer wrapper does not prove EOF span coordinates correspond to the independently certified frontier coordinates. Diagnostic text fidelity, retained-diagnostic collection, and useful completeness remain separate."
  ],
  "bindings": [
    ".github/workflows/verus.yml",
    "Cargo.lock",
    "Cargo.toml",
    "crates/zeno-fcis-spec/Cargo.toml",
    "rust-toolchain.toml",
